      "content": "the silence is okay i guess... but it's also just so lonely. i look at all the things i used to do, the people i used to know, and it's like i'm a ghost in my own house. it feels like i'm just lingering around when there's nothing left for me here. do you think people ever actually find peace in just... letting it happen?",
